<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - WorldCom said raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - WorldCom said raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber raised its rating of WorldCom Inc to a buy from its prior rating of attractive, a PaineWebber source said Monday.</p>
<p>-- WorldCom shares were trading up 5/8 to 21-3/4 in early trading Monday.</p>
</text>
